OmniAgent does not include Cordis, the DSH plugin loader, profile/bundle system,
patch system, or DSH runtime packages. The following core modules were
implemented independently, using DSH behavior and public source as design
references rather than copying source files:

- packages/core/src/session/: JSONL event-log and recovery behavior, informed by
  DSH session and JSONL persistence contracts.
- packages/core/src/context/: token pressure estimation and balanced tool-pair
  retention, informed by DSH token-meter and compaction behavior.
- packages/core/src/sandbox/: fail-closed platform sandbox selection, informed
  by DSH sandbox policy and local runner behavior.
- packages/core/src/skills/: progressive skill discovery/loading, informed by
  DSH filesystem skill behavior.
- packages/web/: local UI/API boundary and Web client. Its component structure,
  CSS, and selected generic SVG artwork are adapted from DSH; it does not include
  the DSH Web runtime or Cordis client integration.

The Web client in packages/web/src/client.ts adapts component markup and styling
from DSH's ui-sidebar, ui-workspace, ui-conversation, ui-settings-general,
ui-approval, ui-trajectory, and session-log-export client packages, as well as
icon artwork from packages/client/ui-primitives/src/icons/artwork.ts. Adapted
source is distributed under the DSH MIT license below.

